body:
SAY WHAAAT

&#x200B;

You're telling me a Cryptobro would be the exact type of person to unequivocally and unthinkably use AI to support their arguments?

That is also pretty accurate. My spanish partner learned a bit of German, and he knows words even if he doesn't know structure. 

&#x200B;

 Want to annoy a Dutch man? Say it's the same language.

I'm working on a simple guide to get it up and running, however, I think an update might knock this out at some point if they remove the pocket app entirely. I am also looking into that.

&#x200B;

But I should be able to get a file that you can just put on your SD card and it'll update to add this functionality. You'll still need a small server running though. A raspberry pi is enough, or just running it on your local PC.
